          },
          {
            "id": 2926915,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "So it looks as if the dodo was better able to survive and defend itself than was originally believed. Yet less than two hundred years after Europeans first arrived on the island, they had become extinct. So what was the reason for this? For a long time, it was believed that the dodos were hunted to extinction. But scientists now believe the situation was more complicated than this.",
